WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.853 --> 00:00:19.783
"Who threw this juice bottle in the trash?" Mom asked.

2
00:00:19.784 --> 00:00:24.471
"We can recycle plastic."

3
00:00:24.472 --> 00:00:28.328
"I did that," Oliver said.

4
00:00:28.329 --> 00:00:32.165
He rinsed the juice bottle.

5
00:00:32.166 --> 00:00:38.604
Then he put it in the recycling bin in the garage.

6
00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:43.051
"Who left this newspaper in the trash?" Mom asked.

7
00:00:43.052 --> 00:00:47.497
"We can recycle newspaper."

8
00:00:47.498 --> 00:00:54.408
"I did that," Dad said.

9
00:00:54.409 --> 00:00:59.088
He put the newspaper in the recycling bin.

10
00:00:59.089 --> 00:01:04.084
"Who left this dog food can in the trash?" Mom asked.

11
00:01:04.085 --> 00:01:09.555
"Rover?" Harry said.

12
00:01:09.556 --> 00:01:13.871
Mom frowned. "I don't think so.

13
00:01:13.872 --> 00:01:18.187
Who's in charge of feeding the dog this week?"

14
00:01:18.188 --> 00:01:22.753
"I am." Harry looked down.

15
00:01:22.754 --> 00:01:28.364
"I was too lazy to rinse the can and recycle it."

16
00:01:28.365 --> 00:01:33.456
"We need to do a better job of recycling," Emmy said.

17
00:01:33.457 --> 00:01:36.871
"That's right!" Mom said.

18
00:01:36.872 --> 00:01:42.332
"Let's make a list of things we can recycle."

19
00:01:42.333 --> 00:01:45.434
The Carters started a list.

20
00:01:45.435 --> 00:01:49.985
"Glass bottles," Oliver said.

21
00:01:49.986 --> 00:01:54.042
"Magazines," Dad said.

22
00:01:54.043 --> 00:01:58.381
"Cardboard and paper," Harry said.

23
00:01:58.382 --> 00:02:04.108
After a while Mom noticed that someone was missing.

24
00:02:04.109 --> 00:02:07.225
"Where's Emmy?"

25
00:02:07.226 --> 00:02:11.642
"I think she went outside," Oliver said.

26
00:02:11.643 --> 00:02:15.311
The Carters went outside.

27
00:02:15.312 --> 00:02:21.118
They found Emmy scooping dirt into a pair of boots.

28
00:02:21.119 --> 00:02:25.681
"I'm recycling too," Emmy said.

29
00:02:25.682 --> 00:02:32.378
"I'm turning my old boots into flowerpots!"
